    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive public transportation and escape Hell in HELLEVATORS, a fluid and challenging 2D-platformer action-roguelike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST YOUR WAY OUT OF HELL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a freshly deceased spirit accidentally sent to Hell due to a clerical error in the celestial bureaucracy. All you have to do to claim your rightful place in Heaven is physically get there, a task easier said than done when all your fellow commuters are after your soul. With an arsenal of spectral weapons, you just might make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/38c00c9916f5439d46185ec6ce5eb11e.poster.avif?t=1754335286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/38c00c9916f5439d46185ec6ce5eb11e.webm?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/38c00c9916f5439d46185ec6ce5eb11e.mp4?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INVEST IN YOURSELF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a fortune and spend it on tons of weapons and assorted passive knick-knacks to grow stronger and stronger as you approach your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/9d75d059c63f3d780616f4f8969d9a45.poster.avif?t=1754335286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/9d75d059c63f3d780616f4f8969d9a45.webm?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/9d75d059c63f3d780616f4f8969d9a45.mp4?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE FRIENDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend local weirdos for their help on your journey. Offer friendly advice and assistance; they'll pay you back with permanent buffs that persist between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/eeb36b2dc302fcdb70da0c972e655dc9.poster.avif?t=1754335286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/eeb36b2dc302fcdb70da0c972e655dc9.webm?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/eeb36b2dc302fcdb70da0c972e655dc9.mp4?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive public transportation and escape Hell in HELLEVATORS, a fluid and challenging 2D-platformer action-roguelike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST YOUR WAY OUT OF HELL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a freshly deceased spirit accidentally sent to Hell due to a clerical error in the celestial bureaucracy. All you have to do to claim your rightful place in Heaven is physically get there, a task easier said than done when all your fellow commuters are after your soul. With an arsenal of spectral weapons, you just might make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/38c00c9916f5439d46185ec6ce5eb11e.poster.avif?t=1754335286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/38c00c9916f5439d46185ec6ce5eb11e.webm?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/38c00c9916f5439d46185ec6ce5eb11e.mp4?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INVEST IN YOURSELF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a fortune and spend it on tons of weapons and assorted passive knick-knacks to grow stronger and stronger as you approach your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/9d75d059c63f3d780616f4f8969d9a45.poster.avif?t=1754335286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/9d75d059c63f3d780616f4f8969d9a45.webm?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/9d75d059c63f3d780616f4f8969d9a45.mp4?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE FRIENDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend local weirdos for their help on your journey. Offer friendly advice and assistance; they'll pay you back with permanent buffs that persist between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/eeb36b2dc302fcdb70da0c972e655dc9.poster.avif?t=1754335286\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/eeb36b2dc302fcdb70da0c972e655dc9.webm?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741570/extras/eeb36b2dc302fcdb70da0c972e655dc9.mp4?t=1754335286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Jump dash, slide, and BLAST your way through Hell's deadly public transit system in this fluid, challenging 2D-platformer Action-roguelike. Make friends with weirdos, amass a horde of mystical knick-knacks, and get frighteningly rich as you battle your way to the surface. WISHLIST NOW!!",
